victory48 = "You've still got it, Akira! Alright, I'm ready for another round!" ;Akira
victory49 = "I'm scared... but I want to move forward... why is that, I wonder..." ;Akuma
;victory49 = "I was concentrating so hard, I can't even remember how I won!" ;Akuma
;victory49 = "Is this what it means to become strong? I may have to start rethinking some things..." ;Akuma
victory50 = "I can feel your desire to get stronger. I love fights like these." ;Alex
;victory51 = "You weren't being serious there, were you? I mean, your moves were easy to evade..." ;Balrog
;victory51 = "You weren't as strong as you loo- ...Ha ha! Just kidding! Don't get mad!" ;Balrog
victory51 = "I thought your punches were pretty good, actually. I definitely did not want to get hit by one of those." ;Balrog
victory52 = "I guess crime does indeed pay... Nope, never mind..." ;Birdie
;victory52 = "I know adding weight makes for an advantage, but... It's not exactly fitting for a swimsuit." ;Birdie
