victory54 = "What... do you fight for?" ;Cammy (Doll)
victory55 = "We'll have to take our time and enjoy the fight next time!" ;Cammy
;victory55 = "Yeah, that was a good fight! Fighting isn't always about life and death, ya'know!" ;Cammy
victory56 = "If only my leg techniques could reach that far like yours." ;Charlie
victory57 = "Erm... did I get in the way of your work? Sorry!" ;Chun-Li
;victory57 = "Take me to work with you sometime, will you? Please?" ;Chun-Li
;victory57 = "Your kicks are just as beautiful as ever. Let's do this again sometime soon!" ;Chun-Li
victory58 = "Hey! Be more energetic! You're looking so old with your current attitude, mister!" ;Cody
;victory58 = "So American prisons really DO have uniforms like that?" ;Cody
;victory58 = "You're into underground street fighting, aren't you? I could tell by your moves." ;Cody
victory59 = "I thought your moves were pretty cool until I realized you used those gadgets!" ;C. Viper
