victory66 = "Your power will be doubled if you attach batons to your legs! Maybe that... will make you stronger?" ;Eagle
victory67 = "Phew, that was fun! Come to Japan next time and we can hang out!" ;Elena
victory68 = "Wake up! This isn't like you, Ryu-san!" ;Evil Ryu
;victory68 = "Ryu-san! Wake up, please!" ;Evil Ryu
;victory69 = "What I yearn for is to be super amazingly powerful!" ;Fei Long
victory69 = "Are you looking for any extras for your new movie?" ;Fei Long
victory70 = "So you can change your fighting stances... I wonder if I can do the same?" ;Gen
