victory71 = "The worries of the world melt away in a fight." ;Gill
victory72 = "So you were Ryu-san's teacher? It's so nice to meet you!" ;Gouken
;victory73 = "I know that I shouldn't be naïve! But I want to believe in myself!" ;Guile
victory73 = "Your moves allow you to cover ground and aerial attacks! I'll have to try that!" ;Guile
