victory74 = "Coooool! I wonder if I should learn some ninjutsu, too?" ;Guy
;victory74 = "Comfortable shoes are a fighter's best friend!" ;Guy
victory75 = "I wish I was a bit taller. It must be nice to be so big!" ;Hugo
;victory76 = "Don't you stand out walking around in those silly pajamas all the time?" ;Ibuki
victory76 = "Seems like your training is pretty difficult. And sorry, I don't know any guys I could introduce you to..." ;Ibuki
victory77 = "Ehehe... I can just never seem to be normal friends with most girls around my age." ;Ingrid
victory78 = "Hey! Chill out! This isn't supposed to be a fight to the death, ya know!" ;Juri
